@Investigacion1_back_HostAddress = http://localhost:5018

### Register (Subscription_L1)
POST {{Investigacion1_back_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Secret1"
}

### Login
POST {{Investigacion1_back_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Secret1"
}

### Refresh
POST {{Investigacion1_back_HostAddress}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (requires accessToken)
POST {{Investigacion1_back_HostAddress}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin register (first Admin is public; later requires Admin JWT)
POST {{Investigacion1_back_HostAddress}}/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin2@example.com",
  "password": "Admin1a"
}

###
GET {{Investigacion1_back_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
